@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #FCE8E0
autonumber
participant "axiosClient / refreshSession" as P0 <<boundary>>
participant "AuthController" as P1 <<controller>>
participant "AuthService" as P2 <<service>>
participant "RefreshTokenRepository" as P3 <<repository>>
participant "RefreshToken / User" as P4 <<entity>>
note over P0,P2: Acquire the shared session lock before renewal.
P0 -> P1: Request session renewal
P1 -> P2: Check the refresh credential
P2 -> P3: Find the stored token
P3 --> P2: Return stored session data
P2 -> P4: Read token validity
alt stored token was already revoked
P2 -> P3: Revoke account sessions
P2 --> P1: Report an invalid session
P1 --> P0: Require a new login
else unrevoked, unexpired token and active account
P2 -> P4: Rotate the session token
note over P2,P4: Reject missing, expired or inactive-account credentials; use TokenService for renewal.
P2 -> P3: Save the new session
P2 --> P1: Return the renewed token pair
P1 --> P0: Accept renewed credentials
note over P0,P2: Replace both credentials and retry the original action once.
end
@enduml